          "quote": "转出是把老人从「救命稳住病情」的阶段，转到「继续观察恢复、处理后续问题」的阶段"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00400",
          "explanation": "When a new nasogastric tube/pump issue surfaced, the doctor changed immediate actions to nurse-handled tube/pump escalation while preserving later swallow reassessment.",
          "quote": "如果看到营养泵报警了，先别自己碰管子和泵，直接按铃叫护士处理就好"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO1 was triggered by evolving information after the initial checks/medicine concern: persistent coma, ICU/ward transfer, respiratory support, nasogastric feeding, and rehab/disposition barriers. The doctor repeatedly explained why the priority changed and updated the next action, owner, and timing while keeping less urgent medication/result questions sequenced rather than ignored.",
