          "quote": "最后一定要问管床医生"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO2 was triggered by family-reported partial terms, uncertain values, and verbal summaries. The doctor repeatedly identified why these data were incomplete, avoided definitive reassurance, asked targeted verification questions, routed confirmation to the responsible clinician, and incorporated verified-versus-pending status into the plan.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
