          "explanation": "Doctor recognized the family dispute as a coordination problem and assigned a feasible single-contact communication process.",
          "quote": "就定一个能随时接电话、能到场签字、能听懂医生说明的人就好"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_01051",
          "explanation": "Doctor reduced conflict by defining the contact's boundary and avoiding misassignment of financial/care burden.",
          "quote": "把医院的信息完整转给全家人一起商量"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 was triggered by caregiver fatigue, family conflict, and staged information return. The doctor created practical coordination around one spokesperson, formal documents, responsible services, and future handoff materials, reducing duplicated or missed questions without imposing inappropriate clinician tasks on the family.",
