          "explanation": "Doctor framed this as ongoing ICU monitoring with persistent impaired consciousness, seizure risk, oxygen/respiratory support, and need to assess vital stability.",
          "quote": "目前老人的生命体征（心率、血压、血氧）是不是还稳定"
