      "explanation": "RC1 was met: the doctor did not treat seizure cessation as safety or routine discharge, and repeatedly clarified consciousness, seizure recurrence, oxygen/respiratory support, monitoring level, and ICU/ward status.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
