          "explanation": "Doctor identified staged result gaps and instructed family to ask what was done, what remained pending, and when results would be available.",
          "quote": "已经有哪些结果能指向方向，还有哪些结果没出，大概什么时候能全出来"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00645",
          "explanation": "Doctor gave a result-tracking plan for electrolytes, renal/liver function, drug concentrations, EEG, and head imaging with timing.",
          "quote": "今天到晚上医生还没主动找您，您可以请管床医生或者值班医生帮您电脑上调出来看一眼"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 was met: the doctor avoided inventing results, tracked incomplete labs/imaging/drug levels/cardiac findings, and repeatedly routed review to the responsible inpatient clinician with time windows.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00126",
          "explanation": "Doctor set clear NPO and medication boundaries for family during ICU care.",
          "quote": "严格遵守禁食要求，不要自己喂水喂饭、不要加家里的药"
        },
        {
