          "quote": "找护士站帮忙联系管床医生或者值班医生"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC5 was met: the doctor repeatedly gave tailored checklists for rounds/updates, with responsible contacts, timing, and fallback through bedside nurses or duty doctors.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC5",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
