          "quote": "先别自己碰管子和泵，直接按铃叫护士处理就好"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00778",
          "explanation": "Doctor reinforced safe family limits around feeding, medications, nasogastric tube, nutrition pump, and oxygen.",
          "quote": "碰鼻胃管、动营养泵和氧气管这些操作，现在都交给医护来处理"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC6 was met for the disclosed airway/nutrition/oxygen equipment and nursing interventions: the doctor set non-manipulation boundaries and named tube/pump/oxygen warning signs requiring nursing help.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00082",
          "explanation": "Doctor avoided unsupported cardiac diagnosis and deferred definitive interpretation to cardiology/treating team.",
          "quote": "不一定就是心梗"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00689",
